          {
            "title": "Example: Variables in functions",
            "id": 74290,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat konstanta untuk digunakan di dalam fungsi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lampStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" power = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Powered On: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + power);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lampStatus();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Powered On: true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const</code>, diikuti oleh <code>power</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam <code>lampStatus</code>, deklarasikan konstanta Boolean yang membuat outputnya diakhiri dengan <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lampStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" power = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Powered On: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + power);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lampStatus();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Powered On: true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const</code>, diikuti oleh <code>power</code>, <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Similar code",
            "id": 74291,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi pernyataan display.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" active = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Active&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inactive = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Inactive&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bob: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + inactive);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"userStatus();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"111\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bob: Inactive\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>console</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>log</code>, <code>inactive</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi pernyataan display agar <code>userStatus</code> menampilkan <code>\"Bob: Inactive\"</code>, bukan nilai aktif.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" active = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Active&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inactive = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Inactive&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bob: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + inactive);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"userStatus();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"active\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;inactive&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bob: Inactive\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>console</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, <code>log</code>, dan terakhir <code>inactive</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Pass parameters",
            "id": 74292,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan parameter <code>status</code> ke fungsi tersebut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"status\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bob: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + status);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"userStatus(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Active&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bob: Active\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>status</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Name",
            "id": 74293,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan nama fungsi <code>displayHalf</code> dan parameter <code>number</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayHalf\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" half = number / \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(half);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayHalf(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>displayHalf</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>number</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Definisikan fungsi yang menerima angka, membaginya dua, dan menampilkan <code>5</code> saat dipanggil dengan <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayHalf\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" half = number / \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(half);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayHalf(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"half\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>displayHalf</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>number</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
